{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19935","headline":"喜与长文上人宿李秀才小山池亭 · 孟郊","name":"喜与长文上人宿李秀才小山池亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"灯尽语不尽，主人庭砌幽。\n柳枝星影曙，兰叶露华浮。\n块岭笑羣岫，片池轻衆流。\n更闻清净子，逸唱颇难俦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19935.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19935","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}